      "sid": 12,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "哎这就是算法要研究的内容"
    },
    {
      "from": 38.92,
      "to": 41.65,
      "sid": 13,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "那么这一节呢就给同学们介绍一下"
    },
    {
      "from": 41.65,
      "to": 44.66,
      "sid": 14,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "关于算法的概念以及算法的特性"
    },
    {
      "from": 44.96,
      "to": 46.55,
      "sid": 15,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "那么什么是算法呢"
    },
    {
      "from": 46.55,
      "to": 49.6,
      "sid": 16,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "嗯我们说嗯有一个问题"
    },
    {
      "from": 49.6,
      "to": 51.71,
      "sid": 17,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "那我们这个问题怎么解决"
    },
    {
      "from": 51.71,
      "to": 54.74,
      "sid": 18,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "嗯这个解决办法我们需要描述出来"
    },
    {
      "from": 54.74,
      "to": 56.09,
      "sid": 19,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "那么算法其实它"
    },
    {
      "from": 56.09,
      "to": 58.13,
      "sid": 20,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "就是对特定问题的求解"
    },
    {
      "from": 58.13,
      "to": 60.239,
      "sid": 21,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "方法和步骤的一种描述"
    },
    {
      "from": 60.239,
      "to": 63.449,
      "sid": 22,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "这个描述呢通常是一条一条的命令"
    },
    {
      "from": 63.449,
      "to": 66.26,
      "sid": 23,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "在计算机里头我们称它指令嗯"
    },
    {
      "from": 66.26,
      "to": 67.49,
      "sid": 24,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "若干条指令"
    },
    {
      "from": 67.49,
      "to": 69.08,
      "sid": 25,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "那么所以我们是说算法"
    },
    {
      "from": 69.08,
      "to": 71.11,
      "sid": 26,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "它是指令的有限序列"
    },
    {
      "from": 71.11,
      "to": 72.49,
      "sid": 27,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "其中每个指令呢"
    },
    {
      "from": 72.49,
      "to": 74.83,
      "sid": 28,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "可以表示一个或者是多个操作"
    },
    {
      "from": 74.83,
      "to": 76.18,
      "sid": 29,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "那么简单的说呢"
    },
    {
      "from": 76.18,
      "to": 79.9,
      "sid": 30,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "算法就是我们解决问题的方法和步骤"
    },
    {
      "from": 79.9,
      "to": 80.98,
      "sid": 31,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "第一步干什么"
    },
    {
      "from": 80.98,
      "to": 81.82,
      "sid": 32,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "第二步干什么"
    },
    {
      "from": 81.82,
      "to": 82.84,
      "sid": 33,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "第三步干什么"
    },
    {
      "from": 82.84,
      "to": 86.36,
      "sid": 34,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "哎这样列出来的指令的一个序列"
    },
    {
      "from": 86.86,
      "to": 89.09,
      "sid": 35,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "那么算法怎么描述呢"
    },
    {
      "from": 89.09,
      "to": 90.59,
      "sid": 36,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "有好多的办法嗯"
    },
    {
      "from": 90.59,
      "to": 91.85,
      "sid": 37,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "那当然最简单的"
    },
    {
      "from": 91.85,
      "to": 92.96,
      "sid": 38,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "最基本的办法"
    },
    {
      "from": 92.96,
      "to": 97.08,
      "sid": 39,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "就是我们用我们日常使用的语言来描述嗯"
    },
    {
      "from": 97.08,
      "to": 97.86,
      "sid": 40,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "比如说这个自"
    },
    {
      "from": 97.86,
      "to": 100.17,
      "sid": 41,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "然语言嗯自然语言嗯"
    },
    {
      "from": 100.17,
      "to": 100.92,
      "sid": 42,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "用中文啊"
    },
    {
      "from": 100.92,
      "to": 102.37,
      "sid": 43,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "英语啊等等嗯"
    },
    {
      "from": 102.37,
      "to": 104.05,
      "sid": 44,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "唉例如我们这块呢"
    },
    {
      "from": 104.05,
      "to": 106.2,
      "sid": 45,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "要求一个一元二次方程的根"
    },
    {
      "from": 106.2,
      "to": 107.58,
      "sid": 46,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "这个一元二次方程呢"
    },
    {
      "from": 107.58,
      "to": 111.3,
      "sid": 47,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "就是ax平方加bx加c等于零啊"
    },
    {
      "from": 111.3,
      "to": 112.55,
      "sid": 48,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "这样的一个方程的根"
    },
    {
      "from": 112.55,
      "to": 114.41,
      "sid": 49,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "那么这个问题怎么解决呢"
    },
    {
      "from": 114.41,
      "to": 117.65,
      "sid": 50,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "诶我们就可以列出来它的这个步骤"
    },
    {
      "from": 117.65,
      "to": 118.63,
      "sid": 51,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "方法嗯"
    },
    {
      "from": 118.63,
      "to": 122.33,
      "sid": 52,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "第一步输入这个方程的三个系数a b c"
    },
    {
      "from": 122.33,
      "to": 126.35,
      "sid": 53,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "第二步我们要判断一下这个二次项的系数"
    },
    {
      "from": 126.35,
      "to": 127.64,
      "sid": 54,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "a是不是等于零"
    },
    {
      "from": 127.64,
      "to": 129.55,
      "sid": 55,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "如果a等于零"
    },
    {
      "from": 129.55,
      "to": 132.59,
      "sid": 56,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "那么我们就提示这不是一个u2 次方程"
    },
    {
      "from": 132.59,
      "to": 133.7,
      "sid": 57,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "a不等于零"
    },
    {
      "from": 133.7,
      "to": 135.23,
      "sid": 58,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "那我们就继续执行"
    },
    {
      "from": 135.23,
      "to": 135.92,
      "sid": 59,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "第三步"
    },
    {
      "from": 135.92,
      "to": 137.57,
      "sid": 60,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "第三步是可以干什么呢"
    },
    {
      "from": 137.57,
      "to": 140.07,
      "sid": 61,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "是计算这个德尔塔德尔"
    },
    {
      "from": 140.07,
      "to": 141.51,
      "sid": 62,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "塔等于b平方减四"
    },
    {
      "from": 141.51,
      "to": 143.349,
      "sid": 63,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "ac算出来了以后呢"
    },
    {
      "from": 143.349,
      "to": 145.659,
      "sid": 64,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "我们判断一下这个德尔塔嗯"
    },
    {
      "from": 145.659,
      "to": 147.069,
      "sid": 65,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "如果德尔塔等于零"
    },
    {
      "from": 147.069,
      "to": 151.06,
      "sid": 66,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "那我们就计算并且输出两个相等的实根"
    },
    {
      "from": 151.48,
      "to": 153.94,
      "sid": 67,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "如果这个德尔塔是小于零的"
    },
    {
      "from": 153.94,
      "to": 156.57,
      "sid": 68,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "那么我们就输出没有十根"
    },
    {
      "from": 156.57,
      "to": 158.52,
      "sid": 69,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "如果这个德尔塔大于零的"
    },
    {
      "from": 158.52,
      "to": 160.23,
      "sid": 70,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "那我们就输出嗯"
    },
    {
      "from": 160.23,
      "to": 163.59,
      "sid": 71,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "计算出来这个两个不等的十根好了"
